abstract: >-
  Research software for medical question answering with retrieval-augmented
  generation. Includes medical-text preprocessing and rechunking, FAISS and
  BM25 index construction, configurable retrieval and reranking, query
  reformulation, evaluation of language-model predictions, and a medical
  RAG chat application.
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdullahmoosa/medrag-research"
url: "https://github.com/abdullahmoosa/medrag-research"
keywords:
  - "retrieval-augmented generation"
  - "medical question answering"
  - "information retrieval"
  - "evaluation"
  - "text chunking"
